   961	during the local development of the built package. Furthermore, it
   962	will probably use local packages instead of packages from _Crates.io_ .
   963	These operations are forbidden when they are uploaded to _Crates.io_
   964	and used by other packages. This configuration setting is mainly
   965	used for local environments but not for other developers who want
   966	to use the functionalities of this package. As a result, our evaluation
   967	process removes local configurations to keep consistent with the
